                      <td align="left" class="text">Another routine trip to Plane of Fire for fun, frolics and of course ... loot.  Tonight's unlucky contestants:<br><ul><li>Jaxoliz Dawneyes</li><li>Criare Sunmane</li><li>Magmaton</li><li>Pyronis</li><li>Quavonis Firetail</li><li>Blazzax the Omnifiend</li></ul><br>The loot:<br><a target="_blank" href="http://lucy.fnord.net/item.html?id=13654">Shining Crimson Shawl</a> - Grats Starlee<br><a target="_blank" href="http://lucy.fnord.net/item.html?id=11323">Shimmering Sleeves of Flame</a> - Grats Kardun<br>Elemental Gauntlets Mold - Grats Numzz & Rasttan<br>Elemental Vambraces Mold - Grats Driftin & Flyingpig<br>Elemental Chain Boot Pattern - Grats Lanis<br>Elemental Silk Bracelet Pattern - Grats Galeni<br><a target="_blank" href="http://lucy.fnord.net/item.html?id=15814">Cape of Flames</a> - Grats Kardun & Symbri<br><br>Today's topic - I am in shock about the upcoming Aerosmith / KISS tour (sponsored by Geritol) and the fact that the tickets cost almost as much as a car payment.&nbsp;</td>
